# Security and store rules

- The service-role key and any model provider key live in Supabase function secrets. The app only has the anon key and RevenueCat public keys.
- Account deletion calls `features/auth/service.ts` `deleteCurrentAccount`, then `signOut`. Do not call `auth.admin` from the client.
- AI prompts pass `assessPrompt` before `runModel`. The edge function repeats that check.
- Tracking uses `PrePermissionModal` with one button labeled `common.continue`. Do not add Allow, Enable, or a second dismiss button.
- Store listing text in `store/listing.json` must not contain Free, Cheap, or a price. Run `npm run metadata` after editing it.
- Preview mode fabricates a local session and skips RevenueCat. Purchases, deletion, and the assistant stay unavailable until real keys replace the preview URL.
- `getSession` must time out and still reveal the login screen. A failed auth request cannot leave the splash screen up.
